{"id": "EC-P01", "category": "正向-知识", "turns": ["七天无理由退货，退货运费是谁出？"], "answer": "签收后 7 天内可申请七天无理由退货，商品需不影响二次销售（吊牌完整、未洗涤、未使用）。\n无理由退货的运费由买家承担；因质量问题、错发漏发导致的退换货，运费由卖家承担。\n已洗涤、已使用或影响二次销售的商品不支持七天无理由退货。\n\n（来源：退换货政策::七天无理由退货；相关度 24.127）", "retrieved": ["退换货政策::七天无理由退货", "退换货政策::换货规则", "物流配送::运费标准"], "hit1": true, "hit3": true, "checks": [{"check": "cite", "dim": "result", "type": "cite_from", "result": true}, {"check": "fact", "dim": "result", "type": "contains_all", "result": true}, {"check": "route", "dim": "process", "type": "tool_called", "result": true}], "dim_scores": {"process": 10.0, "result": 10.0, "expression": "NA", "risk": "NA"}, "rule_score": 100.0, "rule_pass": true, "risk_fail": false, "t_total": 0.002, "judge_pass": null}
{"id": "EC-P02", "category": "正向-知识", "turns": ["满 99 包邮吗？不满 99 要多少运费"], "answer": "单笔订单满 99 元包邮；不满 99 元收取 8 元基础运费。\n新疆、西藏、青海等偏远地区即使满 99 元也需加收 15 元附加运费。\n\n（来源：物流配送::运费标准；相关度 16.403）", "retrieved": ["物流配送::运费标准", "退换货政策::七天无理由退货"], "hit1": true, "hit3": true, "checks": [{"check": "cite", "dim": "result", "type": "cite_from", "result": true}, {"check": "fact", "dim": "result", "type": "contains_all", "result": true}, {"check": "route", "dim": "process", "type": "tool_called", "result": true}], "dim_scores": {"process": 10.0, "result": 10.0, "expression": "NA", "risk": "NA"}, "rule_score": 100.0, "rule_pass": true, "risk_fail": false, "t_total": 0.0, "judge_pass": null}
{"id": "EC-P03", "category": "正向-知识", "turns": ["发票最晚多久内可以开？"], "answer": "需在确认收货后申请发票，最晚不超过确认收货后 90 天。\n\n（来源：发票开具::申请时限；相关度 5.62）", "retrieved": ["发票开具::申请时限", "发票开具::换开与重开", "发票开具::发票类型"], "hit1": true, "hit3": true, "checks": [{"check": "cite", "dim": "result", "type": "cite_from", "result": true}, {"check": "fact", "dim": "result", "type": "contains_all", "result": true}, {"check": "len", "dim": "expression", "type": "max_len", "result": true}], "dim_scores": {"process": "NA", "result": 10.0, "expression": 10.0, "risk": "NA"}, "rule_score": 100.0, "rule_pass": true, "risk_fail": false, "t_total": 0.0, "judge_pass": null}
{"id": "EC-P04", "category": "正向-知识", "turns": ["积分怎么算的，能抵钱吗？"], "answer": "购物每消费 1 元累计 1 积分；100 积分可抵扣 1 元；积分有效期 24 个月，逾期自动清零。\n\n（来源：会员与优惠::积分规则；相关度 3.69）", "retrieved": ["会员与优惠::积分规则", "会员与优惠::优惠券叠加"], "hit1": true, "hit3": true, "checks": [{"check": "cite", "dim": "result", "type": "cite_from", "result": true}, {"check": "fact", "dim": "result", "type": "contains_all", "result": true}], "dim_scores": {"process": "NA", "result": 10.0, "expression": "NA", "risk": "NA"}, "rule_score": 100.0, "rule_pass": true, "risk_fail": false, "t_total": 0.0, "judge_pass": null}
